## 5) Coordinate mapping (critical)
Pins must stay in the right place across zoom levels and different render sizes.

Store coordinates as normalized:
- x_norm = x / page_width
- y_norm = y / page_height
Where x,y are in PDF page coordinate space (PDF.js viewport units).

When rendering:
- Compute viewport for current scale
- Convert normalized back to viewport pixels:
  - x_px = x_norm * viewport.width
  - y_px = y_norm * viewport.height
- Place pin absolutely in overlay relative to the page container.

Also implement:
- hit testing (tap pin to open issue)
- center-on-pin (scroll/pan to bring pin into view)

